# Config YAML

- `param.yaml`: fusion α/β/γ/δ, geo radius, HIGH/MEDIUM thresholds, fraud velocity/lockout.
- `models.yaml`: provider tiers for vision / verify / embed with ordered fallbacks.
- Change thresholds in YAML — avoid hardcoding magic numbers in Python.
- Document units (meters, seconds, Hamming distance) next to keys.
- Keep demo defaults aligned with plan: geo ≤5 km, HIGH ≥0.80, claims ≤3/24h.
